    <string name="s_aee2dba30064">Craving a calming escape from the daily grind? Do you need the perfect soundscape to boost your focus or lull you into peaceful sleep? Look no further than Yumibun, your free and open-source ambient sound generator! Ditch the subscriptions and registrations — with Yumibun, you unlock a world of soothing and immersive audio experiences, entirely for free.</string>
