    <string name="s_630a18b8cc8b">Dive into an expansive library of 84 carefully curated sounds. Nature lovers will find solace in the gentle murmur of streams, the rhythmic crash of waves, or the crackling warmth of a campfire. Cityscapes come alive with the soft hum of cafes, the rhythmic clatter of trains, or the calming white noise of traffic. And for deeper focus or relaxation, Yumibun offers binaural beats and color noise.</string>
