    <string name="s_7531052f56e0">The beauty of Yumibun lies in its simplicity and customization. No complex menus or confusing options — just choose your desired sounds, adjust the volume balance, and hit play. Want to blend the gentle chirping of birds with the soothing sound of rain? No problem! Layer as many sounds as you like to create your personalized soundscape oasis.</string>
